@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Benchmarking methodology (data-driven optimization protocol)
start
:pin CPU affinity
+ set cores to max frequency;<<#F1F3F5>>
:warm up
(prime caches / branch predictors);<<#F1F3F5>>
:perf record --call-graph lbr
or run criterion;<<#FFF3BF>>
:tee output to a file
(run once, analyze many);<<#F1F3F5>>
:generate + analyze perf report
in parallel;<<#FFF3BF>>
stop
note right
  <b>Current coverage:</b> the active
  Criterion targets cover construction,
  DFG/PDG, VF2, and controlled parallel scaling.
  GNN still needs a focused <latex>[[bench]]</latex>
  target before performance claims on that surface.
end note
legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#FFF3BF>| measurement / profiling tool |
  |<#F1F3F5>| setup / bookkeeping step |
endlegend
@enduml
